A description that refuses a plus reads the next line in its body

```
:: t
: +
1. li
+
  - sib
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ol>
      <li>li</li>
    </ol>
    <ul>
      <li>sib</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: +
1. li
+
- sib
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ol>
      <li>li</li>
    </ol>
    <ul>
      <li>sib</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
```
